---
// src/pages/about/_components/AboutGrowth.astro
import Section from '../../../components/ui/Section.astro';
---

<Section height={500} class="py-10 md:py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1fr] gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center">
      <div
        class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-px bg-emerald-100 border border-emerald-100 rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm"
      >
        <div class="bg-cream-50 p-8 text-center hover:bg-white transition-colors">
          <div class="font-serif text-lg lg:text-xl font-bold text-emerald-700 mb-2 leading-tight">
            Trusted by families<br />across the UK, US, and UAE
          </div>
          <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-900/70 uppercase tracking-wide">
            Families enrolled
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-cream-50 p-8 text-center hover:bg-white transition-colors">
          <div class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-emerald-700 mb-2">22</div>
          <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-900/70 uppercase tracking-wide">
            Countries
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-cream-50 p-8 text-center hover:bg-white transition-colors">
          <div class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-emerald-700 mb-2">
            94<span class="text-3xl text-amber-500">%</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-900/70 uppercase tracking-wide">
            Retention (mo 1)
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-cream-50 p-8 text-center hover:bg-white transition-colors">
          <div class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-emerald-700 mb-2">
            4.9<span class="text-3xl text-amber-500">★</span>
          </div>
          <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-900/70 uppercase tracking-wide">
            Average rating
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-cream-50 p-8 text-center hover:bg-white transition-colors">
          <div class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-emerald-700 mb-2">48</div>
          <div class="text-sm font-semibold text-emerald-900/70 uppercase tracking-wide">
            Active teachers
          </div>
        </div>
        <div
          class="bg-cream-50 p-8 text-center hover:bg-white transition-colors relative overflow-hidden"
        >
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-amber-50 opacity-50 pointer-events-none"></div>
          <div class="font-serif text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-bold text-amber-700 mb-2 relative z-10">
            0
          </div>
          <div class="text-sm font-bold text-amber-600 uppercase tracking-wide relative z-10">
            Ads ever run
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <span class="text-xs font-black tracking-widest uppercase text-emerald-700 block mb-3"
          >Our Growth</span
        >
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-emerald-950 mb-6 tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Built without <br /><em class="font-serif italic text-emerald-700 font-medium"
            >a single advertisement.</em
          >
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-emerald-900/80 font-medium mb-10">
          Every family that found Quranific was sent by another family. That is the only metric we
          truly care about: whether parents trust us enough to recommend us.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          <div
            class="bg-cream-50 border border-emerald-100 rounded-2xl p-5 flex items-start gap-5 hover:bg-emerald-50 hover:border-emerald-200 transition-colors"
          >
            <div
              class="px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 text-xs font-bold rounded-full border border-emerald-200 shrink-0"
            >
              2021
            </div>
            <p class="text-[14px] font-medium text-emerald-800/80">
              <strong class="text-emerald-950">Quranific founded.</strong> First 12 families enrolled
              personally by the founder.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="bg-cream-50 border border-emerald-100 rounded-2xl p-5 flex items-start gap-5 hover:bg-emerald-50 hover:border-emerald-200 transition-colors"
          >
            <div
              class="px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 text-xs font-bold rounded-full border border-emerald-200 shrink-0"
            >
              2022
            </div>
            <p class="text-[14px] font-medium text-emerald-800/80">
              <strong class="text-emerald-950">500 families.</strong> First international expansion: UAE,
              Canada, Australia.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="bg-cream-50 border border-emerald-100 rounded-2xl p-5 flex items-start gap-5 hover:bg-emerald-50 hover:border-emerald-200 transition-colors"
          >
            <div
              class="px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 text-xs font-bold rounded-full border border-emerald-200 shrink-0"
            >
              2023
            </div>
            <p class="text-[14px] font-medium text-emerald-800/80">
              <strong class="text-emerald-950">1,400 families.</strong> Teacher vetting formalised. Safeguarding
              policy launched.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div
            class="bg-cream-50 border border-emerald-100 rounded-2xl p-5 flex items-start gap-5 hover:bg-emerald-50 hover:border-emerald-200 transition-colors"
          >
            <div
              class="px-3 py-1 bg-emerald-100 text-emerald-700 text-xs font-bold rounded-full border border-emerald-200 shrink-0"
            >
              2024
            </div>
            <p class="text-[14px] font-medium text-emerald-800/80">
              Trusted by families across the UK, US, and UAE. 22 countries. Adult learning launched.
              Zero ad spend.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Section>
